{"title":"Minute","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Minutes</b> is unit of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Time\" title=\"Time\">time</a>, and is equivalent to 60 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Second\" title=\"Second\">seconds</a> or 1/60 of an <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hour\" title=\"Hour\">hour</a>.\n</p><p>Another meaning is a small amount, e.g \"A minute amount of ...\"\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Minute&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018095659\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 259/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.499      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.499      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7444:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018095659 and revision id 275112. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}